# What this resource holds back from a release. One pattern per line, matched
# against the whole path; `*` matches anything.
#
# Everything at the top of the repository that a server does not load and a
# buyer does not read is named here, so this file alone says what ships.
# spec/shipping_spec.lua fails for a top-level file that is neither shipped on
# purpose nor named below.
STATUS.md
.gitignore
.nyrignore
# In a git worktree .git is a file pointing at the repository, not a directory.
.git
# NYR-Lang's list of rule sources (tools/nyr/*.nyr) and the modules nyrc builds from them; the
# modules ship, the list is for nyrc.
nyr.json

# Server state and local operator configuration never belong in a buyer zip.
data/*.json
data/*.json.*
*.cfg
*.cfg.local
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
